title Over the sideline
intro Blue has the ball near the side.
flip vertical

setup
  lineup 7v7
  player B-RF at 56.7, 51.7
  ball with B-RF

step
  caption Blue has the ball near the sideline.

step
  caption Blue kicks it — all the way over the sideline!
  ball to 71.4, 73.4
  arrow from B-RF to ball
  draw sideline bottom
  duration 1450

question
  prompt Who gets the ball?
  answer Red
  wrong Blue
  wrong Nobody
  wrong Play on
  correct Red's ball.
  why Blue last touched it over the sideline, so Red throws it in.

question
  prompt What restart is it?
  answer Throw-in
  wrong Goal kick
  wrong Corner
  wrong Kick-off
  correct Throw-in.
  why Over the sideline, the other team throws it back in.

step
  caption Red is ready to throw it back in.
  R-LB to 71.4, 66.6
  ball with R-LB
  label R-LB Throw
  draw sideline bottom

step
  caption Red throws it back onto the field.
  ball to 65.1, 55.8
  arrow from R-LB to ball
  banner Throw-in
  draw sideline bottom
  duration 1100
